                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Make sure you get the Enhanced Splinter Cell mod by Joshhhuaaa. It is a major unofficial PC patch for the 2002 original Tom Clancy's Splinter Cell. It modernizes the classic by adding native controller support, widescreen and 60 FPS caps via dgVoodoo2, original Xbox lighting restoration, and cut missions like the Nuclear Power Plant. I have the Enhanced SC v1.4b and the game works flawless with controller. Link provided to the GitHub page or just look up EnhancedSC.\n\nhttps://github.com/Joshhhuaaa/EnhancedSC",
